      "type": "text", "id": "ev1_t", "x": 88, "y": 1026, "width": 440, "height": 140,
      "text": "CAPABILITIES  (auth/rbac.py)\n  TENANT_ADMIN   → VIEW_TENANT_CONFIG, REASSIGN_LEADS,\n                    VIEW_AUDIT_LOGS, REVEAL_PII …\n  AGENT          → VIEW_TENANT_RECORDS, CREATE_EDIT,\n                    REVEAL_PII, VIEW_DASHBOARDS\n  READ_ONLY      → VIEW_TENANT_RECORDS, VIEW_AUDIT_LOGS\n                    (no reveal)\n  PLATFORM_ADMIN → PLATFORM_HEALTH, REPLAY_DISCARD_DLQ",
      "originalText": "CAPABILITIES  (auth/rbac.py)\n  TENANT_ADMIN   → VIEW_TENANT_CONFIG, REASSIGN_LEADS,\n                    VIEW_AUDIT_LOGS, REVEAL_PII …\n  AGENT          → VIEW_TENANT_RECORDS, CREATE_EDIT,\n                    REVEAL_PII, VIEW_DASHBOARDS\n  READ_ONLY      → VIEW_TENANT_RECORDS, VIEW_AUDIT_LOGS\n                    (no reveal)\n  PLATFORM_ADMIN → PLATFORM_HEALTH, REPLAY_DISCARD_DLQ",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
