      "text": "platform.auth_sessions\n  token_hash  = sha256(cookie token)\n               ↑ raw token never stored\n  user_id     → platform.users(id)\n  expires_at, revoked_at\n  valid  ⇔  revoked_at IS NULL\n            AND expires_at > now()",
